OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for mosque threats
OL,4,Aafter synagogue attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA CPS spokesman said it later emerged
OL,7,Fhe had called the Iqra Mosque in
OL,8,FManchester on the same day, telling a
OL,9,Fstaff member: "I am going to kill you
OL,10,FMuslim."
